# Keeps the build context small and correct.
#
# Without this, `node_modules` (larger than the resulting image) and every previous
# `.next` build are uploaded to the daemon on every single build, which is the
# difference between a few seconds and a couple of minutes.

node_modules
.next
out
dist

# Not needed to build, and some of these are large or machine-specific.
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Editor and OS noise.
.DS_Store
.idea
.vscode
*.swp

# The Dockerfile and this file are not part of the dependency graph or the
# source tree the app serves, so keeping them out avoids a needless cache bust
# when only a comment changes.
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
